                                "sense_id": "8b6d3c3a-2ba3-3ecc-8eb8-994f2df58f81",
                                "text": "He propagandized this panacea with single-minded determination throughout the revolutionary period and even managed to establish a People's Bank for a short time before his arrest in 1849."
                            }
                        ]
